# Third-party notices — SmartPress

SmartPress is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later.
See `LICENSE` for the full text.

SmartPress is licensed under the GPL because it vendors **libimagequant**, which
is GPL-3.0-or-later for open-source use. That is a deliberate choice, recorded in
`AI-Logs.md`: palette quantization is where the PNG savings live (measured at
−87% to −93%, against ~20% for lossless-only), and no permissively licensed
quantizer matched it. See the Sprint 1.2 entry for the alternatives considered.

